    "Cookie reconstruction changes only the discard value representation; name/value/domain/path/Secure/HttpOnly/session/absolute expiry checks and original text ownership remain strict.",
    "Pinned WebKit Cocoa uses NSNumber true for session discard. This is bounded primary support, not proof both current Darwin cases now pass; safe Boolean diagnostics keep failures explicit.",
